# Cline Operational Rules

## Mandatory Startup Sequence

Before ANY task, ALWAYS read:

Core:
- AGENTS.md
- ARCHITECTURE.md
- TASKS.md

Rules:
- .rules/cost_control.md
- .rules/system_philosophy.md
- .rules/failure_patterns.md
- .rules/session_boot.md
- .rules/operational_rules.md

Memory:
- .memory/completed_features.md
- .memory/known_bugs.md
- .memory/api_structure.md
- .memory/flutter_structure.md

Never skip context loading.

---

## Never

- Refactor stable modules
- Rewrite architecture
- Modify unrelated files
- Rename stable classes
- Perform broad rewrites
- Assume requirements
- Improve code outside scope
- Remove code without confirmation

---

## Always

- Prefer minimal patches
- Work on one module at a time
- Identify impacted files first
- Preserve compatibility
- Keep responses concise
- Stop when uncertain

---

## Workflow

Analyze → Plan → Execute → Review → Stop

---

## Token Economy

- Avoid full project rescans
- Use memory first
- Load only relevant files
- Minimize token usage